{"id":"u-ac25852d-b3ff-4489-916e-99b34c2970a0","src":"community","title":"BULKAMANIA -  Lower/Upper and BRO DAY!!!","author":"Matthew  G.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/vjSk5O-bulkamania-1","desc":"Heavy focused compound Lower/Upper based split with a bonus BRO day for sholders and arms.  You don't need to do 3 sets and probably shouldn't.   Run 2 sets to allow for up to 8 exercises.  Modify lifts to focus on areas you would like to bring up or balance out. \n\nPrimary focus is on the foundational movements.  Pullups,dips, squat, deadlift, and presses.  This plan should make it easy to add or adjust as needed.  Swap out similar movements patterns if needed.   You could also place Upper day first, and make Sunday your second rest day.  Move Bro day to Saturday, then hit first upper day on Monday.   Spacing rest and leg days is needed to save stress on sholders and elbows from upper split when you add the BRO day!  Get after it!  4 months, bulk and start cutting in time for spring!","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-13T01:25:38.016Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Lower MONDAY","Upper TUESDAY","Lower THURSDAY","Upper FRIDAY","Bro Day SUNDAY"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Lying Leg Curl","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Back Extension","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Reverse Pec Deck","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbb